          },
          "message": "Adds a start/4 (#10)\n\n* Adds a start/4\r\n\r\nstart/4 allows the caller to know whether or not they started the\r\nworker process.  lookup_or_start/4 is transparent about whether the\r\nworker process was started fresh or already existed. Some use cases\r\nrequire that the caller be able to tell whether or not they started\r\nthe worker process.\r\n\r\nstart/4 will error if the worker process already exists with\r\n`{:error, {:already_started, pid}}` similar to how a Supervisor\r\nbehaves when a child is already running.\r\n\r\n* Update CI to run on all published versions",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "771307b3ad04356a119e811e827c062b71c37ada",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/gen_registry/git/trees/771307b3ad04356a119e811e827c062b71c37ada"
          },
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/gen_registry/git/commits/561cf3fa027246008f02fe2150248b38785b15fa",
          "comment_count": 0,
          "verification": {
            "verified": true,
            "reason": "valid",
            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJjRaJcCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAIu0IAF9n1xYo1XgxehtfHCFLxtaF\neV9zgdQZQPpRR/iQqD/jAwkRKdDlP0SMpv8OU2KwKuvQYCxKekt6GdTvwvEgcdL2\nfvqrpjQL/pT+Ia31jLReky9Aw4arY7j+pT/NF7quaQBkcqn6UEPbuP8TvafovSUK\nqhYSaR/CmempEDXwqeMqKpScRb0SVUGFyVM057dqmJJDJQ+o5vOQkfm7aploFuHk\n07OV2e3unDMkwuOwhJJBJSpLieGdaUINdZcGot/8/cEGXARmcRClC+jHvAjWWrfa\npxB3qZYJ8pe0Ix+H6EzDLIsP377vUDOOBCpaZ3SscgMyAyP8T4AprQOyV+FHmsc=\n=8RGF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree 771307b3ad04356a119e811e827c062b71c37ada\nparent 6ee002c2b82f6cf3e73b186bb32ea8b68a3b2316\nauthor Matt Nowack <matt@discordapp.com> 1665507932 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1665507932 -0700\n\nAdds a start/4 (#10)\n\n* Adds a start/4\r\n\r\nstart/4 allows the caller to know whether or not they started the\r\nworker process.  lookup_or_start/4 is transparent about whether the\r\nworker process was started fresh or already existed. Some use cases\r\nrequire that the caller be able to tell whether or not they started\r\nthe worker process.\r\n\r\nstart/4 will error if the worker process already exists with\r\n`{:error, {:already_started, pid}}` similar to how a Supervisor\r\nbehaves when a child is already running.\r\n\r\n* Update CI to run on all published versions"
